      "value": "This issue is still present in VRChat. When a ContactSender that is actively triggering a ContactReceiver is deactivated or hidden, the Receiver parameter value spikes to its maximum of 1.0 for exactly one frame.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
